From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0266: FastRPC listener on its static handle

0265 attached to the sensors PD (retval 0) but its remotectl open of
"adsp_listener" never got an answer. libadsprpc does not open the listener:
it invokes static handle 3 (init2 0x03000000, next2 0x04020200). Now the same;
reverse calls are served while any other call waits (an open can need them),
next2 retval 0x2e is retried, adsp_default_listener is opened with 20 s and
registered. More log: every outgoing message and its buffer, and on a timeout
the channel receive buffers and queue, the ADSP state and the SMMU global
fault registers.
